{
  "job_B1.4.23_20251001_193238": {
    "text": "Wyrdwriteras us secga\u00f0, \u00f0a \u00f0e awritan be cyningum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea ealdan cyningas on \u00f0am \u00e6rran timan\n\u00d0a gesetton \u00fea cyningas, him sylfum to fultume, ealdormen under him, and hi oft asendon to manegum\nDauid se m\u00e6ra cyning, \u00feeah \u00f0e he cene w\u00e6re, he asende his heretogan, swa swa hit seg\u00f0 on leden on\nfactum est ergo, uertente anno, eo tempore quo solent reges procedere ad bella, misit dauid ioab, et\nDauid se cyning asende eft ioab on \u00f0am o\u00f0ran geare to \u00f0am ammoniscum, and he oferwann hi mid \u00fe\u00e6s\ndixit ergo dauid, nunc magis aflicturus est nos siba filius bochri, et cetera.\nSiba w\u00e6s gehaten sum dauides \u00feegena, se astyrode \u00fe\u00e6t folc mid feondlicre spr\u00e6ce ongean \u00feone cyning\n\u00d0a fleah se siba mid fleamdome aweg; ac ioab se heretoga his heafod begeat \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re burhware \u00fee he to\nfactum est autem rursum prelium aduersus israhel philistinorum, et cetera.\nEft w\u00e6s geworden wi\u00f0 israhel gefeoht; on \u00f0am gefeohte w\u00e6s sum wundorlic ent se wolde ofslean \u00feone\n\u00d0a sworon sona \u00f0\u00e6s cyninges \u00f0egenas ealle, and s\u00e6don him \u00feus to: ne scealt \u00f0u n\u00e6fre heonon for\u00f0 mid\nConstantinus, se casere \u00f0e \u00e6rest beah to cristendome, h\u00e6fde \u00e6nne heretogan se hatte gallicanus, \u00feone\nAnd se gallicanus wear\u00f0 sy\u00f0\u00f0an swa halig \u00fe\u00e6t he wundra worhte and wear\u00f0 gemartirod for criste, swa\nGratianus w\u00e6s gehaten sum healic casere, swy\u00f0e on god gelyfed, swa swa us seg\u00f0 seo boc tripartita\n\u00d0a wunnon wi\u00f0 hine \u00fea wildan h\u00e6\u00feenan, ac se casere asende him sona togeanes theodosium his\n\u00d0a caseras woldon \u00f0a cenan men ofaxian, and him fultum findan and hi eac fyr\u00f0rian to ealles folces\nTheodosius se gingra and se wur\u00f0fulla casere sende oft his heretogan, swa swa us seg\u00f0 seo racu, to\nLangsume tale we magon macian be \u00f0ysum gif we wylla\u00f0 secgan be \u00feam \u00f0e us secga\u00f0 bec, of \u00feam \u00f0e\nMoyses se m\u00e6ra, \u00fee mihte wi\u00f0 god sprecan, he asende iosue, swa swa us seg\u00f0 exodus, togeanes\n\u00d0is gewr\u00e6c saul eft sy\u00f0\u00f0an on amalech, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he be godes h\u00e6se gehergode \u00feone eard, and \u00fea\nUre wissung and ure waru sceal beon of gode, and we sceolon secan \u00e6t gode sylfum urne r\u00e6d mid",
